  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Using the Reverb G2, when a controller idles after a short period of inactivity, it triggers one-handed-mode. If the menu window is open while this happens, I end up clicking the safe mode button with my next action. This happens several times a session. While uncertain, I think the active controller lines up with the safety button by default when this occurs. An easy fix would be to allow me to completely disable automatic one-handed-movement upon controller loss. Addressing wider WMR controller needs would be appreciated.",
